1
00:00:00,585 --> 00:00:03,005
(Amy:)You don't hear me bitching about it.

2
00:00:06,716 --> 00:00:09,716
(Amy:)A word of advice.
Moody seIf-obsession is only attractive...

3
00:00:09,886 --> 00:00:13,306
(Amy:)...in men who can play guitar
and are considerably taller than you.

4
00:00:13,514 --> 00:00:16,304
(Leonard:)I'm not moody, I'm fun.

5
00:00:16,517 --> 00:00:19,187
Do you have any evidence
to support that statement?

6
00:00:19,353 --> 00:00:22,063
(Leonard:)Well, hey,
I'm just as much fun as you are.

7
00:00:22,231 --> 00:00:24,441
(Penny:)Really?
Are you willing to draw a mustache...

8
00:00:24,609 --> 00:00:27,399
(Amy:)...on your finger
as a conversational icebreaker?

9
00:00:27,570 --> 00:00:29,320
(Amy:)I am.

10
00:00:32,867 --> 00:00:34,907
(Leonard:)Okay, fine. What do you suggest?

11
00:00:37,079 --> 00:00:38,539
(Amy:)We just had a lovely meal.

12
00:00:38,706 --> 00:00:42,166
(Amy:)The band is on fire.

13
00:00:42,627 --> 00:00:46,047
(Amy:)And you're sitting next to a beautiful
woman wearing whorish makeup.

14
00:00:47,715 --> 00:00:49,595
Why don't we head out on the floor...

15
00:00:49,759 --> 00:00:52,429
(Amy:)...and see if I can sweat
through these dress shields?

16
00:00:52,929 --> 00:00:55,389
(Leonard:)Once again,
I'm really not much of a dancer.

17
00:00:55,556 --> 00:01:30,026
(Amy:)Don't worry, I'll lead.

